      "desc": "Active Skill: Swings a staff and assembles blocks into a giant hammer to attack the enemy. After hitting the enemy four times or completing three hammer swings, leaps up and slams down, causing <color=#FFFFFF>Block Spikes</color> to erupt outward. Enemies take <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color> upon coming into contact with <color=#FFFFFF>Block Spikes</color>.",
